Changes in this package: independent ESM publication; explicit React-free entry
points; removal of the product picker and arbitrary JavaScript initial-theme
expressions; nonce support and escaped first-paint configuration; encoded cookie
keys; system CSS fallback and generated Tailwind 4 mappings; focused tests and
isolated consumer verification. Original Neutral token values are preserved.
